        ✔ scoop install pnpm（12.4.2；env_set 接管 PNPM_HOME → D:\Software\Scoop\apps\pnpm\current，bin/global/store/cache/state persist + post_install；current\bin 已自动入 PATH）@critical @done(26-09-16 22:30)
            注：均在 main bucket，无需加桶
        ✔ fnm install 22 && fnm default 22（Node v22.23.2；落 FNM_DIR 接管路径，经 persist 存 D 盘；fnm ls 证 default 别名指向 v22.23.2）@critical @done(26-09-16 22:41)
